  orderGid                                 gid         Order                              kept by kind: a reference to another row; a link: a row that names an in-scope order here is in scope
  parentTransactionGid                     gid         OrderTransaction                   kept by kind: a reference to another row; a link: a row that names an in-scope orderTransaction here is in scope
  paymentDetails                           object      PaymentDetails                     scrubbed: the key is removed
  paymentIcon                              object      Image                              scrubbed: the key is removed
  paymentId                                scalar      String                             scrubbed: becomes "[redacted]"
  processedAt                              scalar      DateTime                           kept by kind: a date-time
  receiptJson                              scalar      JSON                               scrubbed: the key is removed
  settlementCurrency                       scalar      CurrencyCode                       kept by the list: the currency of the sale
  settlementCurrencyRate                   scalar      Decimal                            kept by kind: a decimal
