  status                                   enum        OrderTransactionStatus             kept by kind: an enum
  test                                     scalar      Boolean                            kept by kind: a boolean
  totalUnsettledSet                        object      MoneyBag                           kept by the list: an amount of the sale
  userGid                                  gid         StaffMember                        kept by kind: a reference to another row; a link that reaches nothing: no erasure reaches a staffMember

